<h1>Intellectual Property, Open Access & Academic Attribution Policy</h1>
<p>Effective Date: September 29, 2026 • MAE Academy</p>
<p>MAE Academy is an open-access engineering platform providing interactive simulation tools and indexing public academic literature strictly for educational, non-commercial purposes.</p>
<h2>Academic Library Indexing</h2>
<p>The MAE Academy library index acts as an educational discovery tool. We do not host, store, or distribute copyrighted textbooks on private servers for profit. Instead, we leverage open public metadata and legal digital archives, primarily the Internet Archive (<a href="https://archive.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">archive.org</a>), under fair use and Open Educational Resources (OER) principles.</p>
<h2>Academic Research Discovery</h2>
<p>Our research module functions as an academic metadata aggregator. Paper records and citations are queried securely through established open-access discovery indices, including <a href="https://openalex.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenAlex</a> and <a href="https://www.doabooks.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DOAB</a>. We are strictly committed to preserving all original author attributions, Digital Object Identifiers (DOIs), and adhering to their respective open licenses.</p>
<h2>Proprietary Simulation Engines</h2>
<p>All client-side interactive simulators, mathematical solvers, physical modeling scripts, visual interfaces, and animation architectures are original intellectual property created and maintained by MAE Academy. They operate client-side in the browser and are protected by applicable copyright legislation.</p>
<h2>DMCA Notice & Takedown Procedure</h2>
<p>MAE Academy respects the intellectual property rights of creators and copyright owners. If you believe in good faith that any indexed record or reference on our platform infringes your copyright, please submit a formal written notice to our compliance address:</p>
<p><a href="mailto:contact@maeacademy.org">contact@maeacademy.org</a></p>
<p>Our Commitment: We pledge to review and verify any formal notice, and promptly delist or remove any contested third-party reference within 48 business hours of receipt.</p>
</main>
